0..75 Comment "// Including an imported theory (#1224): a theory is a named presentation a"
76..152 Comment "// client imports, so `include` names a block of a source its source imports"
153..230 Comment "// unqualified as it names one of its own. The imported monoid is extended by"
231..307 Comment "// a chosen element; a model of the extension gives the monoid\'s members and"
308..333 Comment "// the element, and runs."
